sequenceDiagram
  participant FC as Future calls
  participant DB as Postgres DoseEvent / Alert
  participant BUS as care_bus
  participant Pat as Patient app
  participant Care as Caregiver app

  Note over FC,Care: At scheduledAt
  FC->>DB: remind → status scheduled → reminded
  FC->>BUS: post CareUpdate dose
  BUS-->>Pat: dose card shows reminder
  BUS-->>Care: overview refreshes

  alt Patient taps Taken within grace
    Pat->>DB: markTaken → reminded → taken
    Pat->>BUS: post CareUpdate
    BUS-->>Care: adherence updates
  else Grace expires DHATRI_GRACE_MINUTES default 20
    FC->>DB: escalate → reminded → missed
    FC->>DB: insert Alert missedDose
    FC->>BUS: post CareUpdate alert
    BUS-->>Care: live missed-dose alert
  end
